A||||21||Archie||The Pedal is gone||||9||
Z||000000||Archie||10-26-2001||12:19 AM||||The Steel clutch pedal for the Fiero is gone. It has been discontinued by GM.<P>I have already searched & no dealers have any stock of these parts.<P>If you've been having clutch problems and have been delaying buying the steel pedal that will cure most of your problems, you're too damn late.<P>I feel that there is someone out there Hoarding a large supply of these items to lay it into us at a later date.<P>We as concerned Fiero owners need to write letters to GM asking them to bring this part back. <P>OR, we need to encourage someone like Rodney to start making a part that virtually every stick shift Fiero is going to need.<P>Archie ||||reg||9
