Z||000013||Archie||10-26-2001||03:43 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroMaster88:<BR><B>Crap!  I need one.  Wonder where I can find one......Hmmmmmm......    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>does anyone have the part number for one?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The pn is 10066423.... I would suggest for everyone to call their local dealer and ask for that number.... & while you are still on the phone make them check for availability. It will take a couple minutes for them to do that then they will tell you that it no longer is available. Maybe if enough people call GM will get the word that we still need that part.<P>If you think you might need a pedal go to this site and read the symptoms and cures <A HREF="http://v8archie.com/arch7.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://v8archie.com/arch7.htm</A> <P>If you are grinding a little going into 1st. right now then you better be getting that thing fixed.<P>Archie<P>------------------<BR>Just how fast do you want to go?<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 10-26-2001).]||||reg||1
